From 6a20a8a4c7bf4e9cdd5798c7366716024463872c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cognava <dev@samuhia.co.ke>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:16:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Plot Yangu: Samuhia rebrand, new logos/icons/splash, modern
 sticky headers and mobile bottom nav

- Brand: Plot Yangu house mark (purple #7A3E8E, amber door), outlined lockups, favicon/ico, PWA any+maskable,
  MS tiles, iOS startup images, social image, Capacitor sources, Android launcher + splash (brand/, npm run brand)
- Text: Cogvana -> Samuhia, SMB Kenya (Ltd) -> Plot Yangu, cogvana.co.ke -> samuhia.co.ke
- UI: shared sticky PageHeader (Dashboard, Properties, Invoices, Payments, Profile, Settings) with actions;
  bottom nav rebuilt as equal-width grid with safe area, Settings last; floating download/upload on Dashboard
